  "description": "SIBJAQ crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C48 H108 K2 O13 Tb4,C6 H14. From the CIF bond table, Tb1 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors; Tb2 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors; Tb3 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors; Tb4 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.443-4.795 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 87.24-169.72°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Tb4K2O(OtBu)12]·C6H14.",
